      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical vehicle holding charges if my car needs to be transported separately?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Vehicle holding charges cover the time a car spends at the loading dock before loading onto the dedicated multi‑car trailer. Packers And Movers In Varoda charge a nominal fee of ₹250‑₹500 per hour, depending on the vehicle size, with a maximum daily cap. This fee ensures safe handling and prevents unnecessary delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why should I choose professional packers and movers for home shifting in Varoda?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Professional packers and movers bring expertise in handling delicate items, use a 7‑layer protective packaging system, and have specialized equipment like hydraulic ramps and wheel chocks. Their IBA approval and ISO certification guarantee adherence to safety standards, reducing the risk of damage and ensuring a hassle‑free relocation.</p>
